          {"name" => "StorageClassName", "type" => "string", "format" => "", "description" => "storageClassName represents the name of the StorageClass that the reported capacity applies to. It must meet the same requirements as the name of a StorageClass object (non-empty, DNS subdomain). If that object no longer exists, the CSIStorageCapacity object is obsolete and should be removed by its creator. This field is immutable.", "priority" => 0}.freeze,
